WEBVTT

00:07:57.162 --> 00:08:02.681
Na moja ya kitu kizuri zaidi
ni kuwa nimetumia Podium

00:08:02.705 --> 00:08:07.791
kunisaidia kujiandaa kwa leo,
na imekuwa ya msaada mkubwa.

00:08:07.815 --> 00:08:09.442
Lakini ni zaidi ya hapo.

00:08:09.466 --> 00:08:11.020
Kuna la zaidi laweza kufanyika.

00:08:12.274 --> 00:08:15.366
Kwa watu wenye ASD --

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:19.907
Imekuwa ikidhaniwa
kuwa wavumbuzi wengi wa kisayansi,

00:08:19.931 --> 00:08:24.522
watafiti, wasanii 
na wahandisi wanayo;

00:08:24.546 --> 00:08:30.576
kama, mfano, Emily Dickinson,
Jane Austen, Isaac Newton, and Bill Gates